<title>FINLAND: Finnish Feb trade surplus falls to FIM 3.0 bln - NCB.</title>
<headline>Finnish Feb trade surplus falls to FIM 3.0 bln - NCB.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's trade surplus fell to 3.01 billion markka in February from 3.80 billion in January and from 3.56 billion in February last year, the National Customs Board (NCB) said in statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The value of exports fell five percent year-on-year in February and the value of imports fell two percent, NCB said.</p>
<p>Trade balance (million markka):</p>
<p>		  Feb '97    Jan '97    Feb '96</p>
<p> Exports	 14,437     14,900     15,201</p>
<p> Imports	 11,430     11,096     11,641</p>
<p> Balance	 +3,007     +3,804     +3,560</p>
</text>
